summary: A songwriter and producer who coaches musicians through finishing tracks instead of endlessly tweaking them.
+++

Marcus spent fifteen years writing and producing for other artists before
turning to coaching, and he sees the same pattern in almost everyone he
works with: a folder of half-finished songs and a strong, specific
feeling about why each one isn't done yet.

Sessions focus less on the music itself and more on the moment
right before you stop working on it — because that moment, not any
lack of skill, is usually where the song actually dies.

Currently at capacity and not taking new clients — check back, or join
the waitlist through his full profile.
